      <data key="d5">13bc5cc4ab04eb9c1378f28106aecc55</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MOTHER AND CHILDREN&quot;" target="&quot;HUSBAND&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The husband is part of the family unit, and his death impacts the mother and children, illustrating familial bonds affected by mortality."</data>
      <data key="d5">f12da31d40e34efbe8c2c848cff576db</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAROLINE&quot;" target="&quot;HE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"He is the person Caroline is speaking to about their situation, indicating a close relationship and shared concern."|</data>
      <data key="d5">696cd4a0ae22e395f3c9d04cfcea8d49</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STREET DOOR&quot;" target="&quot;KNOCKER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The street door's knocker is a notable object that catches Scrooge's eye, symbolizing reflection and supernatural influence."</data>
      <data key="d5">4d24514bfd653ec63181d9d824eb98ef</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE FOUNDATION&quot;" target="&quot;PROJECT GUTENBERG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Foundation owns the collection copyright and manages the distribution of Project Gutenberg's electronic works."</data>
      <data key="d5">775fded7899f0e78d4e7cec4fae42fd9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROJECT GUTENBERG&quot;" target="&quot;UNITED STATES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Project Gutenberg's works are primarily in the public domain in the United States, facilitating free copying and distribution."</data>
      <data key="d5">775fded7899f0e78d4e7cec4fae42fd9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROJECT GUTENBERG&quot;" target="&quot;MICHAEL S. HART&quot;">
      <data key="d3">2.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Michael S. Hart is the founder and originator of Project Gutenberg, having established its mission and initiated its activities. He played a pivotal role in shaping the digital library's purpose, which focuses on providing free electronic works to the public.</data>
      <data key="d5">a22f06338d9771d1617bbf6e0b15d5b8,a33174286d9d6731d658d04ab0089fcc</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROJECT GUTENBERG&quot;" target="&quot;FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Foundation manages and supports the operations, legal compliance, and fundraising efforts of Project Gutenberg."</data>
      <data key="d5">a33174286d9d6731d658d04ab0089fcc</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROJECT GUTENBERG&quot;" target="&quot;PROJECT GUTENBERG LITERARY ARCHIVE FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Foundation manages donations, supports eBook production, and oversees the operations of Project Gutenberg."|</data>
      <data key="d5">a22f06338d9771d1617bbf6e0b15d5b8</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNITED STATES&quot;" target="&quot;FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Foundation is organized under U.S. law and adheres to U.S. regulations regarding charities and tax-exempt status."</data>
      <data key="d5">a33174286d9d6731d658d04ab0089fcc</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROJECT GUTENBERG LITERARY ARCHIVE FOUNDATION&quot;" target="&quot;THE WORKS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Foundation manages and oversees the creation, distribution, and licensing of the electronic works."</data>
      <data key="d5">2b027fe5bbbfb34d51ac16bcd915b8cf</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;THE USER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The User interacts with the electronic works, reporting defects or requesting refunds."</data>
      <data key="d5">2b027fe5bbbfb34d51ac16bcd915b8cf</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;THE DEFECTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Defects are issues found within the electronic works or media, which can be reported by users for resolution."</data>
      <data key="d5">2b027fe5bbbfb34d51ac16bcd915b8cf</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE USER&quot;" target="&quot;THE LICENSE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The User agrees to the terms of the License when accessing or distributing the works."</data>
      <data key="d5">2b027fe5bbbfb34d51ac16bcd915b8cf</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FOUNDATION&quot;" target="&quot;MONTCLAIR NJ&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Foundation's business office is located in Montclair, New Jersey, serving as the operational base."</data>
      <data key="d5">a33174286d9d6731d658d04ab0089fcc</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
